OL,3,GNEWSASouthport Pier restoration 'ahead
OL,4,Aof schedule'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to restore Southport's Grade
OL,7,FII-listed pier is "ahead of schedule",
OL,8,Fthe project manager has said.
OL,10,FThe Victorian pier, which is the second
OL,11,Flongest in Britain, has been closed
OL,12,Fsince December 2022 because of safety
OL,13,Fconcerns.
OL,15,FIt is being restored after the
OL,16,Fgovernment approved #20m funding for
OL,17,Fdecking boards and timber joists to be
OL,18,Freplaced, and extensive steelwork
OL,19,Frepairs.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
