OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASouthport Pier restoration 'ahead
OL,4,Aof schedule'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDale Cunniffe, project manager from A E
OL,7,FYates, the project construction and
OL,8,Fengineering company, told BBC Radio
OL,9,FMerseyside they expected the
OL,10,Frestoration to be completed by mid-2028
OL,11,F"but, all being well, we'll bring that
OL,12,Fforward".
